replies.body:
@paulagosta thank you for the Initial Package Checklist. that's very helpful. One possible gap: the MAS, CPO and SDR rows calculate Action Required from the Assessment Completion Date (B7). On the deadlines page, though, the grace period for those rulesets runs to "the first FedRAMP independent assessment started after" 2027-01-01, 2027-07-01 and 2027-08-01. But you noted elsewhere that these should be tied to when your assessment started.

Should the checklist get an Assessment Start Date field which the MAS CPO and SDR action required formulas use? Or am i misunderstanding? 

Also want to verify that if we carry a low POAM for VER/VDR, that we can show this is resolved/implemented just through the VER reports instead of an independent validation/assessment.
